8.639960  	alpha1            ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-4.693423 	alpha2            ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
